{%- set dir = dest_rel_dir -%}
# {{ name }}

## Purpose

{{ description }}

## Structure

| Path | Contents |
| ---- | -------- |
{% if language == "rust" -%}
{% if layer == "application" -%}
| `src/main.rs` | Startup and wiring only |
| `src/lib.rs` | The crate's modules and public API, so integration tests can use it |
{% else -%}
| `src/lib.rs` | The crate's modules and public API |
{% endif -%}
| `Cargo.toml` | Crate manifest; version and edition come from the workspace |

The workspace files live at the repository root: `Cargo.toml`, `Cargo.lock` and `rust-toolchain.toml`.
{%- else -%}
{% if layer == "application" -%}
| `src/main.ts` | The entry point |
| `package.json` | The bun package `{{ name }}` |
{% else -%}
| `src/<module>.ts` | One module each, imported as `@evie/{{ name }}/<module>` |
| `package.json` | The bun package `@evie/{{ name }}`; its `./*` export maps each subpath to `src/` |
{% endif -%}
| `tsconfig.json` | Compiler options for `typecheck`; extends the root `tsconfig.base.json` |

Biome and TypeScript are dev dependencies of the root `package.json`, and `biome.json` at the root configures Biome. Dependencies install into the root `bun.lock`.
{%- endif %}

## Commands

{% if language == "rust" -%}
The tasks come from [`.moon/tasks/rust.yml`](../../.moon/tasks/rust.yml), shared by every Rust crate.

| Command | What it does |
| ------- | ------------ |
| `moon run {{ name }}:build` | Compile the crate |
| `moon run {{ name }}:lint` | Lint with clippy |
| `moon run {{ name }}:check` | Run `lint` (clippy also checks the types), then check the formatting with rustfmt |
| `moon run {{ name }}:test` | Run the unit and integration tests |
| `moon run {{ name }}:format` | Format the crate with rustfmt |
{%- else -%}
The tasks come from [`.moon/tasks/typescript.yml`](../../.moon/tasks/typescript.yml), shared by every TypeScript project.

| Command | What it does |
| ------- | ------------ |
| `moon run {{ name }}:lint` | Lint with Biome |
| `moon run {{ name }}:check` | Run `lint` and `typecheck`, then check formatting and imports with Biome |
| `moon run {{ name }}:typecheck` | Check the types with `tsc` |
| `moon run {{ name }}:test` | Run the tests with `bun test` |
| `moon run {{ name }}:format` | Format the code and organize imports with Biome |
{%- endif %}

## Local rules

{% if language == "rust" -%}
- Follow the `rust-conventions` skill.
- Add crates with `cargo add <crate>` inside `{{ dir }}/`. Commit `Cargo.lock`, since every task runs with `--locked`.
{%- else -%}
- Follow the `typescript-conventions` skill.
- Add packages with `bun add <pkg>` inside `{{ dir }}/`; shared dev tools go in the root `package.json`.
{%- endif %}
